{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000002", "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "you don't know what is appears to move and move, the difference between the two, then basically you haven't understood the concept very well. Because of that reason, you need to know definition.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000003"}], "text": "Learn the definition of the topic to understand it well."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Second one is a bookish example", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000002"}], "text": "Learn a bookish example, typically given in official documentation."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Third one is a practical example", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000002"}], "text": "Understand a practical example of the topic for application."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "here are the three things that I recommend everyone to study. First is definition. Second one is a bookish example. Third one is a practical example.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000002"}], "text": "The three-part thumb rule for understanding any topic involves studying its definition, a bookish example, and a practical example."}, "title": "Three-part Thumb Rule for Studying", "topic": "study_method"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:knowledge:52bafbea4a0ae9aa", "metadata_hash": "e6fb342cb5fe943f2d34b976659391ddb917004617605254ee76b4e596491998", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "Three-part Thumb Rule for Studying", "topic": "study_method", "topic_slug": "study_method"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000005"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "without fundamentals of JavaScript, whether you pick React, Angular, Vue or any other framework, Node.js or any other framework, you're not gonna master it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000005"}], "text": "Without understanding the fundamentals of JavaScript, one cannot master frameworks like React, Angular, or Vue because these fundamentals are extremely important."}, "title": "Importance of JavaScript Fundamentals", "topic": "frontend_development"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:knowledge:151f6eb7e6e2d77d", "metadata_hash": "e6fb342cb5fe943f2d34b976659391ddb917004617605254ee76b4e596491998", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "Importance of JavaScript Fundamentals", "topic": "frontend_development", "topic_slug": "frontend_development"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000006"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "these concepts I feel like extremely important, hoisting, closure, promises, function currying, execution context, call apply bind and polyfills.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000006"}], "text": "It is essential to learn concepts like hoisting, closure, promises, function currying, execution context, call apply bind, and polyfills in JavaScript."}, "title": "Essential JavaScript Concepts", "topic": "frontend_development"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:knowledge:dd101a93c7d34832", "metadata_hash": "e6fb342cb5fe943f2d34b976659391ddb917004617605254ee76b4e596491998", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "Essential JavaScript Concepts", "topic": "frontend_development", "topic_slug": "frontend_development"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "if you're learning something for the sake of job, my recommendation is learn React and not any other framework, okay? Or any other library.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000008"}], "text": "For job opportunities, it is recommended to learn React over other frameworks like Angular or Vue.js as React has more opportunities in the job market."}, "title": "React versus Other Frameworks", "topic": "frontend_development"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:knowledge:698c528528acfdb8", "metadata_hash": "e6fb342cb5fe943f2d34b976659391ddb917004617605254ee76b4e596491998", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "React versus Other Frameworks", "topic": "frontend_development", "topic_slug": "frontend_development"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000014", "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000015"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "so only I've divided portfolio into two parts. One is basic portfolio, another one is a advanced portfolio.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000014"}], "text": "Create both a basic and an advanced portfolio. A basic portfolio includes personal information and simple projects, while an advanced portfolio addresses specific niche problems and demonstrates distinctive skills."}, "title": "Basic and Advanced Portfolio", "topic": "portfolio_development"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:knowledge:ea05eca1a828406e", "metadata_hash": "e6fb342cb5fe943f2d34b976659391ddb917004617605254ee76b4e596491998", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "Basic and Advanced Portfolio", "topic": "portfolio_development", "topic_slug": "portfolio_development"}
