{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000022", "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000023"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "the progress was extremely important than perfection. So I wanted to deliver things not necessarily in the right way. Because of which what happened I never understood the fundamentals concepts of JavaScript.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000022"}], "text": "The progress of work was prioritized over perfection, leading to a lack of understanding of fundamental JavaScript concepts."}, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": {"citations": [{"quote": "Even after I'm three years of experience I did not know none of these basics.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000023"}], "text": "The speaker felt 'extremely hollow' and realized a lack of understanding in JavaScript basics even after three years of experience."}, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "I got an opportunity to work in like startups and mid-range companies where the the progress was extremely important than perfection.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000022"}], "text": "The speaker reflects on their past experiences working at startups and mid-range companies."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Mistakes in Learning JavaScript", "topic": "JavaScript learning"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-